"Dragontamer" <prtiglao@gmail.com> wrote:

> What should I expect on the ascention run?
Frustration until you get out of Gehennom. The planes are a bit of a 
suprise the first time you meet them (even if you read the spoilers nothing 
much prepares you for the astral plane).

> Anything else I can to to prepare myself?
You say you haven't explored all the Gehennom levels: make sure you at 
least know the path between the stairs on each level.

> Any other gear that I need?
Some cursed potions of gain level. As many wands of teleport as you can 
find.

> Any tips on finding the Vibrating Square?
Walk round the level systematically until you find it. Once you've found 
it, mark it somehow (I usually break a wand of digging on it).


